:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Sardine (Enemy)]].''
'''Sardine''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can obtained from the [[Summer Break Cats Castaway (Event Gacha)|Summer Break Cats Castaway]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]] using Legend Traps. It was added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 766
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Sardine
|name2 = Sardine CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sardine CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Very similar to [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] in terms of usage. Cheap and expendable, it can be summoned en masse to take hits in place of other, more important units. This meatshield role is quite valuable, if not for the wide selection of cats able to perform this role, usually with a lower cost.

Sardine, however, has the ability to [[Dodge Attack|dodge]] Floating enemies. This doesn't help it much though, since the chance is so laughably low. It might be somewhat useful in pure-Floating stages, but other than that, it's better to use cheaper meatshields, such as [[Catburger (Special Cat)|Catburger]].

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

